    {
      "id": "3bfb4be9-d457-433b-a137-c1ca0aeadaa5",
      "title": "Escute e leia a frase. Repare de onde começa a mudança e o que continua acontecendo agora.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "81af22a8-8ea0-4557-9b4e-cf17755cb35d",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute e leia a frase.</p><p><strong>Desde que probamos el menú de mediodía, volvemos a esa taberna cada viernes.</strong></p><p>Em portugues: <strong>Desde que provamos o menu do meio-dia, voltamos a essa taberna toda sexta-feira.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/120f8a7eb89548d99e97f3f15bd8bf1f_phase4-b01-desde-que-probamos-el-menu-de-mediodia.mp3?Expires=1794099846&Signature=paHrc7CifgqVgxGzu5OKwwpPC3vHqIQkJBZpB14gJGzsRvhJDWGbzs34~pN3m-EtCZdkt7eUDFkgppH1ERXuqL0lcSTSD2yToIJr7MxacQ9wIKsdD66guy6THUNXYb5sys9Dem~bwJ2oqM4ds3c6CvrAXeuIFhRyXAuApW6-IrUUve~SfY47Gm8Nlsfh72WiKwZ1ZpXcUDPGIehkMLIElY57Em2v2LjbdvVgU8k3qBIlfYXTUfwkztc~3djEOUSQSGWNnE785w5kZuB9xeaQP1-74St1oe-AE46vRZtf79mCB2~CCsHK6BxQKOF41X2GFIbx7bUBh1n8jgdwbrVslg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
